Follow **`.AI/docs/03-front.md`** and **`.AI/docs/07-ai-md-workflow.md`**.

- Humans may request **dev only**; auto-create/update `.AI/md/specs/<feature>.md` first
- Stitch HTML → `front/publish/` then convert to React
- Shared UI → `front/src/components/common/`
- HTTP only via `front/src/services/api.js`
- Then `.AI/md/jobs/front/` (APIs + filenames). No `.AI/md/API` edits on front-only work.
